  "name": "original-stingrayish-protocol",
  "description": "A high-throughput decentralized AI compute marketplace protocol implementing an object-centric state model and bounded counter accounts for concurrent spending. It utilizes the Morpheus DAG-based consensus to provide a dual-path execution model featuring a low-latency speculative fast path alongside a finalized slow path. The architecture minimizes on-chain overhead by storing only cryptographic commitments and delegating complex negotiation and compute validation to off-chain actors.",
